#. Enable/Disable Kdump - RadioButtons 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:34
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable/Disable Kdump</b><br>\n"
"    Enable or disable kdump. The \"crashkernel\" boot parameter is added/"
"removed. \n"
"    To apply changes, a reboot is necessary.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເປີດ/ປິດໃຊ້ງານ Kdump</b><br>\n"
"    ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານ kdump. ພາລາມິເຕີການບູດ \"crashkernel\" ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມ/ລຶບອອກ. \n"
"    ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່.<br></p>\n"

#. Kdump Memor&y [MB] - IntField 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:40
msgid ""
"<p><b>Kdump Memory</b><br>\n"
"    Allocation of memory for the kdump kernel.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ Kdump</b><br>\n"
"    ການຈັດສັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສຳລັບເຄີເນິນ kdump.</p>"

#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:43
msgid ""
"<p>On AMD64/Intel 64 computers, the <i>High</i> value means reserving all "
"available memory. The <i>Low</i> value means reserving memory in the DMA32 "
"zone, that is, all the memory up to the 4 GB mark.<br>\n"
"<i>Low</i> is the amount of memory required by 32-bit-only devices. The "
"kernel will allocate 64M for DMA32 bounce buffers. If your server does not "
"have any 32-bit-only devices, everything should work with the default "
"allocation of 72M for <i>Low</i>. A possible exception to this is on NUMA "
"machines, which may make it appear that more Low memory is needed. The Kdump "
"kernel may be booted with numa=off to make sure normal kernel allocations do "
"not use <i>Low</i> memory."
msgstr ""
"<p>ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີ AMD64/Intel 64, ຄ່າ <i>High</i> ໝາຍເຖິງການຈອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຄ່າ "
"<i>Low</i> ໝາຍເຖິງການຈອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນເຂດ DMA32, ນັ້ນຄື, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທັງໝົດຈົນຮອດຂີດ 4 "
"GB.<br>\n"
"<i>Low</i> ແມ່ນປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ອຸປະກອນແບບ 32-bit ເທົ່ານັ້ນຕ້ອງການ. ເຄີເນລຈະຈັດສັນ 64M ສ"
"ຳລັບບັບເຟີ bounce DMA32. ຖ້າເຊີບເວີຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ມີອຸປະກອນແບບ 32-bit ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ທຸກຢ່າງຄວນຈະເຮັດວຽກ"
"ໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຈັດສັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ 72M ສຳລັບ <i>Low</i>. ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ NUMA, ເ"
"ຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຕ້ອງການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ Low ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເຄີເນລ Kdump ອາດຈະຖືກບູດດ້ວຍ numa=off "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຈັດສັນເຄີເນລປົກກະຕິບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ <i>Low</i>."

#. T: help text for a combo box
#. description taken from http://lparbox.com/how-to/aix/19
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:52
msgid ""
"<p><b>Firmware-Assisted Dump</b><br>\n"
"    Dumps are not generated before the partition is reinitialized but take "
"place     when the partition is restarting. When performing a firmware-"
"assisted dump,     system memory is frozen and the partition rebooted, which "
"allows a new instance     of the operating system to dump data from the "
"previous kernel crash.    This feature is suitable only when the system has "
"more than 1.5 GB of memory.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ການດັມພ໌ທີ່ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໂດຍເຟີມແວ (Firmware-Assisted Dump)</b><br>\n"
"    ການດັມພ໌ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ພາທິຊັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ ແຕ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພາທິຊັນກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່. ເມື່ອ"
"ເຮັດການດັມພ໌ທີ່ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໂດຍເຟີມແວ, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງລະບົບຈະຖືກຢຸດໄວ້ ແລະພາທິຊັນຈະຖືກບູດໃໝ່, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້"
"ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຕົວໃໝ່ສາມາດດັມພ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກການຄຣັຊຂອງເຄີເນິນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໄດ້. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເໝາະສົມສະເພາະເມື່ອລ"
"ະບົບມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1.5 GB ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.</p>"

#. Kdump Memor&y [MB] - IntField 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:63
msgid ""
"<p><b>Dump Level</b><br>\n"
"    Specify the type of necessary page for analysis.\n"
"    Pages of the specified type are copied to the dumpfile. \n"
"    The page type marked in the following table is included. <br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ລະດັບການດັມພ໌</b><br>\n"
"    ລະບຸປະເພດຂອງໜ້າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການວິເຄາະ.\n"
"    ໜ້າຂໍ້ມູນຂອງປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກຄັດລອກໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ດັມພ໌. \n"
"    ປະເພດໜ້າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໝາຍໄວ້ໃນຕາຕະລາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນໄດ້ລວມເຂົ້າແລ້ວ. <br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:70
msgid ""
"<p><b>Dump Format</b><br>\n"
"    <i>No Dump</i> - Only save the kernel log.<br>\n"
"    <i>ELF Format</i> - Create dump file in ELF format.<br>\n"
"    <i>Compressed Format</i> - Compress dump data by each page with gzip."
"<br>\n"
"    <i>LZO Compressed Format</i> - Slightly bigger files but much faster."
"<br>\n"
"</p>    <i>Snappy Compressed Format</i> - Considerably faster, 64-bit "
"optimized.<br>\n"
"</p>    <i>Zstandard Compressed Format</i> - Smaller files, slower.<br>\n"
"</p>    <i>Raw copy of /proc/vmcore</i> - does not use makedumpfile.<br>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຮູບແບບການດັມພ໌</b><br>\n"
"    <i>ບໍ່ມີການດັມພ໌</i> - ບັນທຶກສະເພາະບັນທຶກຂອງເຄີເນິນ (kernel log).<br>\n"
"    <i>ຮູບແບບ ELF</i> - ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ດັມພ໌ໃນຮູບແບບ ELF.<br>\n"
"    <i>ຮູບແບບບີບອັດ</i> - ບີບອັດຂໍ້ມູນການດັມພ໌ໃນແຕ່ລະໜ້າດ້ວຍ gzip.<br>\n"
"    <i>ຮູບແບບບີບອັດ LZO</i> - ໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍແຕ່ໄວຫຼາຍ.<br>\n"
"    <i>ຮູບແບບບີບອັດ Snappy</i> - ໄວຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ, ເໝາະສຳລັບ 64-bit.<br>\n"
"    <i>ຮູບແບບບີບອັດ Zstandard</i> - ໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍກວ່າ, ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ.<br>\n"
"    <i>ສຳເນົາຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງ /proc/vmcore</i> - ບໍ່ໃຊ້ makedumpfile.<br>\n"
"</p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  1/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:81
msgid ""
"<p><b>Saving Target for Kdump Image</b><br>\n"
"    The target for saving kdump images. Select the target type for saving "
"dumps.<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ບ່ອນບັນທຶກເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບຮູບພາບ Kdump</b><br>\n"
"    ເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump. ເລືອກປະເພດເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການບັນທຶກການດັມພ໌.<br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  2/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:85
msgid ""
"<p><b>Local Filesystem</b> - Save the kdump image in the local filesystem.\n"
"    <i>Directory for Saving Dumps</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    Selecting directory for saving kdump images via dialog by pressing "
"<i>Browse</i>\n"
"    <br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃນເຄື່ອງ</b> - ບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ.\n"
"    <i>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສຳລັບບັນທຶກການດັມພ໌</i> - ເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບການບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump.\n"
"    ເລືອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສຳລັບບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump ຜ່ານກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໂດຍການກົດ <i>ເລືອກເບິ່ງ (Browse)</"
"i>\n"
"    <br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  3/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:92
msgid ""
"<p><b>FTP</b> - Save kdump image via FTP.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the ftp server.\n"
"    <i>Port</i> - The port number for the connection.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    <i>Enable Anonymous FTP</i> enables anonymous connection to the server.\n"
"    <i>User Name</i> for ftp connection. <i>Password</i> for ftp connection."
"<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>FTP</b> - ບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump ຜ່ານ FTP.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ເຊີເວີ</i> - ຊື່ຂອງເຊີເວີ ftp.\n"
"    <i>ພອດ</i> - ໝາຍເລກພອດສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"    <i>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນເຊີເວີ</i> - ເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບການບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump.\n"
"    <i>ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ FTP ແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນ</i> ເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນກັບເຊີເວີ.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</i> ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ftp. <i>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</i> ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ftp.<br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  4/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:101
msgid ""
"<p><b>SSH</b> - Save kdump image via SSH and 'dd' on target machine.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the server.\n"
"    <i>Port</i> - The port number for the connection.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    <i>User Name</i> for SSH connection.  \n"
"    <i>Password</i> for SSH connection.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>SSH</b> - ບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump ຜ່ານ SSH ແລະ 'dd' ໃນເຄື່ອງເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ເຊີເວີ</i> - ຊື່ຂອງເຊີເວີ.\n"
"    <i>ພອດ</i> - ໝາຍເລກພອດສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"    <i>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນເຊີເວີ</i> - ເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບການບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</i> ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH.  \n"
"    <i>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</i> ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH.<br></p>\n"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  5/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:110
msgid ""
"<p><b>SFTP</b> - Save kdump image via SFTP.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the server.\n"
"    <i>Port</i> - The port number for the connection.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    <i>User Name</i> for SSH connection.  \n"
"    <i>Password</i> for SSH connection.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>SFTP</b> - ບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump ຜ່ານ SFTP.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ເຊີເວີ</i> - ຊື່ຂອງເຊີເວີ.\n"
"    <i>ພອດ</i> - ໝາຍເລກພອດສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"    <i>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນເຊີເວີ</i> - ເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບການບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</i> ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH.  \n"
"    <i>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</i> ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH.<br></p>\n"

#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:118
msgid ""
"<p>The choice between SSH and SFTP depends\n"
"on details of server configuration. SLE servers support both\n"
"by default.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ການເລືອກລະຫວ່າງ SSH ແລະ SFTP ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ\n"
"ລາຍລະອຽດການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຊີເວີ. ເຊີເວີ SLE ຮອງຮັບທັງສອງແບບ\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.</p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  6/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:124
msgid ""
"<p><b>NFS</b> - Save kdump image on NFS.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the nfs server.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>NFS</b> - ບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump ໃນ NFS.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ເຊີເວີ</i> - ຊື່ຂອງເຊີເວີ nfs.\n"
"    <i>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນເຊີເວີ</i> - ເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບການບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump.<br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  7/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:130
msgid ""
"<p><b>CIFS</b> - Save kdump image via CIFS.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the server.\n"
"    <i>Exported Share</i> - The windows share name.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    <i>Use Authentication</i> enables authenticated connection to the "
"server.\n"
"    <i>User Name</i> for the connection. <i>Password</i> for the connection."
"<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>CIFS</b> - ບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump ຜ່ານ CIFS.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ເຊີເວີ</i> - ຊື່ຂອງເຊີເວີ.\n"
"    <i>ແຊຣ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ</i> - ຊື່ແຊຣ໌ຂອງ windows.\n"
"    <i>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນເຊີເວີ</i> - ເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບການບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ kdump.\n"
"    <i>ໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ</i> ເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ມີການຢືນຢັນຕົວກັບເຊີເວີ.\n"
"    <i>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</i> ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. <i>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</i> ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.<br></p>"

#. Custom Kdump Kernel - TextEntry 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:139
msgid ""
"<p><b>Custom Kdump Kernel</b> The user can enter the custom kernel.\n"
"    The naming scheme is:<i>/boot/vmlinu[zx]-<kernel_string>[.gz]</i>\n"
"    Please enter only <i>kernel_string</i>.<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເຄີເນິນ Kdump ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ</b> ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປ້ອນເຄີເນິນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້.\n"
"    ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ແມ່ນ:<i>/boot/vmlinu[zx]-<kernel_string>[.gz]</i>\n"
"    ກະລຸນາປ້ອນພຽງແຕ່ <i>kernel_string</i> ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.<br></p>"

#. Kdump Command Line - TextEntry 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:145
msgid ""
"<p><b>Kdump Command Line</b>\n"
"    Additional arguments passed to kexec. <br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ Kdump</b>\n"
"    ອາກິວເມນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຍັງ kexec. <br></p>"

#. Kdump Command Line Append - TextEntry 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:149
msgid ""
"<p><b>Kdump Command Line Append</b>\n"
"    Set this option to _append_ values to the default command line string. \n"
"    The string will be appended if the <i>Kdump Command Line</i>\n"
"    is set. <br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເພີ່ມຕໍ່ທ້າຍບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ Kdump</b>\n"
"    ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອ _ເພີ່ມຕໍ່ທ້າຍ_ ຄ່າໃສ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. \n"
"    ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເພີ່ມຕໍ່ທ້າຍຖ້າ <i>ບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ Kdump</i>\n"
"    ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້. <br></p>\n"

#. Enable Immediate Reboot After Saving the Core - CheckBox 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:156
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable Immediate Reboot After Saving the Core</b> - \n"
"    Enable immediate reboot after saving the core in the kdump.<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກ Core</b> - \n"
"    ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກ core ໃນ kdump.<br></p>"

#. Enable Delete Old Dump Images - CheckBox 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:160
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable Delete Old Dump Images</b> - \n"
"    Enable Delete Old Dump Images. If the number of dump files in \n"
"    <i>Number of Old Dumps</i> exceeds this number, older dumps are removed."
"<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການລຶບຮູບພາບການດັມພ໌ເກົ່າ</b> - \n"
"    ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການລຶບຮູບພາບການດັມພ໌ເກົ່າ. ຖ້າຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ດັມພ໌ໃນ \n"
"    <i>ຈຳນວນຂອງການດັມພ໌ເກົ່າ</i> ເກີນຈຳນວນນີ້, ໄຟລ໌ດັມພ໌ທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ.<br></p>"

#. SMTP Server
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:166
msgid ""
"<p><b>SMTP Server</b> used for sending a notification email after a dump.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເຊີເວີ SMTP</b> ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສົ່ງອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນຫຼັງຈາກມີການດັມພ໌.</p>"

#. SMTP User Name
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:170
msgid ""
"<p><b>User Name</b> for SMTP authentication when <i>SMTP Server</i> is\n"
"  set. This is optional. If you do not specifiy a username and password, "
"plain SMTP will be used.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> <b>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</b> ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SMTP ເມື່ອ <i>ເຊີບເວີ SMTP</i> ຖືກ\n"
"  ຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ອັນນີ້ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, SMTP ແບບທຳມະດາຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້.</p>\n"

#. SMTP Password
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:174
msgid ""
"<p><b>Password</b> for SMTP authentication when <i>SMTP Server</i> is set. "
"This\n"
"  is optional. If you do not specify a username and password, plain SMTP "
"will be used.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b> ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SMTP ເມື່ອ <i>ເຊີເວີ SMTP</i> ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ນີ້\n"
"  ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ລະບຸຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ SMTP ແບບປົກກະຕິ.</p>\n"

#. Notification To (email addresses)
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:178
msgid ""
"<p><b>Notification To</b> Specify the email address to which a notification "
"email will be sent when a dump has been saved.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາ</b> ລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາເມື່ອມີການບັນທຶກການດັມພ໌ແລ້ວ.</p>"
"\n"

#. Notification CC (email addresses)
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:182
msgid ""
"<p><b>Notification CC</b> Specify a list of space-separated email addresses "
"to\n"
" which a notification email will be sent via cc if a dump has been saved.</"
"p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ແຈ້ງເຕືອນ CC</b> ລະບຸລາຍຊື່ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວ (ແຍກດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ) ທີ່ຈະ\n"
" ສົ່ງອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາຜ່ານ cc ຖ້າມີການບັນທຶກການດັມພ໌ແລ້ວ.</p>\n"

#. Number of Old Dumps (number)
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:186
msgid ""
"<p><b>Number of Old Dumps</b> specifies how many old dumps are kept. If the "
"number of dump files \n"
"exceeds this number, older dumps are removed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຈຳນວນຂອງການດັມພ໌ເກົ່າ</b> ລະບຸວ່າຈະເກັບການດັມພ໌ເກົ່າໄວ້ຈັກອັນ. ຖ້າຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ດັມພ໌ \n"
"ເກີນຈຳນວນນີ້, ການດັມພ໌ທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ.</p>"

#. Read dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:190
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Initializing Kdump Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Kdump</big></b><br>\n"
"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Read dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:194
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Initialization:</big></b><br>\n"
"Safely abort the configuration utility by pressing <b>Abort</b> now.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງຍົກເລີກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກເຄື່ອງມືການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍການກົດ <b>ຍົກເລີກ (Abort)</b> ດຽວນີ້.</p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:198
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Saving Kdump Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Kdump</big></b><br>\n"
"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:202
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Saving:</big></b><br>\n"
"Abort the save procedure by pressing <b>Abort</b>.\n"
"An additional dialog informs whether it is safe to do so.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງຍົກເລີກການບັນທຶກ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກຂັ້ນຕອນການບັນທຶກໂດຍການກົດ <b>ຍົກເລີກ (Abort)</b>.\n"
"ຈະມີກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບເພີ່ມເຕີມແຈ້ງບອກວ່າປອດໄພທີ່ຈະເຮັດຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:209
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Kdump Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Configure kdump here.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Kdump</big></b><br>\n"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ kdump ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.<br></p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:213
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding a Kdump:</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose an kdump from the list of detected kdumps.\n"
"If your kdump was not detected, select <b>Other (not detected)</b>.\n"
"Then press <b>Configure</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການເພີ່ມ Kdump:</big></b><br>\n"
"ເລືອກ kdump ຈາກລາຍການ kdumps ທີ່ກວດພົບ.\n"
"ຖ້າ kdump ຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ຖືກກວດພົບ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>ອື່ນໆ (ກວດບໍ່ພົບ)</b>.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ <b>ຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Configure)</b>.</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:220
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting:</big></b><br>\n"
"If you press <b>Edit</b>, an additional dialog in which to change\n"
"the configuration opens.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ການລຶບ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ (Edit)</b>, ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງ\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນ.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:226
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Kdump Configuration Overview</big></b><br>\n"
"Obtain an overview of installed kdumps. Additionally\n"
"edit their configurations.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ພາບລວມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Kdump</big></b><br>\n"
"ເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງ kdumps ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ\n"
"ຍັງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນໄດ້.<br></p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:232
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding a Kdump:</big></b><br>\n"
"Press <b>Add</b> to configure a kdump.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການເພີ່ມ Kdump:</big></b><br>\n"
"ກົດ <b>ເພີ່ມ (Add)</b> ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ kdump.</p>"

#. Ovreview dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:236
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting:</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose a kdump to change or remove.\n"
"Then press <b>Edit</b> or <b>Delete</b> as desired.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ການລຶບ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ເລືອກ kdump ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບອອກ.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ (Edit)</b> ຫຼື <b>ລຶບ (Delete)</b> ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.</p>\n"

