#: src/include/kdump/uifunctions.rb:1771
msgid ""
"Kdump is not supported on this system.\n"
"If you continue now, the module may not function properly.\n"
"For example, some settings will not be correctly read\n"
"and the resulting configuration will probably be useless.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kdump ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນລະບົບນີ້.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານສືບຕໍ່ດຽວນີ້, ໂມດູນອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ບາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະບໍ່ຖືກອ່ານຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ\n"
"ແລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້.\n"

#: src/include/kdump/uifunctions.rb:1777
msgid "Kdump not supported"
msgstr "Kdump ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ"

