msgstr "ຮູບແບບການດັມພ໌ສຳລັບຮູບພາບດັມພ໌: none/ELF/compressed/lzo/snappy/zstd/raw"

#. TRANSLATORS: CommandLine help
#: src/lib/kdump/clients/kdump.rb:95
