msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍການດັມພ໌ລວມມີປາຍທາງສຳລັບບັນທຶກຮູບພາບດັມພ໌"

#. TRANSLATORS: CommandLine help
#: src/lib/kdump/clients/kdump.rb:110
msgid ""
"The naming scheme is:/boot/vmlinu[zx]-<kernel_string>[.gz] Please enter only "
"\"kernel_string\"."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ແມ່ນ:/boot/vmlinu[zx]-<kernel_string>[.gz] ກະລຸນາປ້ອນພຽງແຕ່ "
"\"kernel_string\"."

#. TRANSLATORS: CommandLine help
#: src/lib/kdump/clients/kdump.rb:121
msgid ""
"The kdump commandline is the command line that needs to be passed off to the "
"kdump kernel."
msgstr "kdump commandline ແມ່ນບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງເຄີເນິນ kdump."

#. TRANSLATORS: CommandLine help
#: src/lib/kdump/clients/kdump.rb:132
msgid ""
"Set this variable if you only want to _append_ values to the default command "
