"Error updating initrd while calling '%{cmd}'.\n"
"See %{log} for details."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການອັບເດດ initrd ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ '%{cmd}'.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ %{log} ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

#. Kdump read dialog caption
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:537
msgid "Initializing kdump Configuration"
msgstr "ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ kdump"

#. Progress stage 1/4
#. Progress step 1/4
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:546 src/modules/Kdump.rb:554
msgid "Reading the config file..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງອ່ານໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ..."

#. Progress stage 3/4
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:548
msgid "Reading kernel boot options..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງອ່ານຕົວເລືອກການບູດເຄີເນິນ..."

#. Progress stage 4/4
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:550
msgid "Calculating memory limits..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງຄິດໄລ່ຂີດຈຳກັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ..."

#. Progress step 2/4
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:556
msgid "Reading partitions of disks..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງອ່ານພາທິຊັນຂອງດິສກ໌..."

#. Progress finished 3/4
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:558
msgid "Reading available memory and calibrating usage..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງອ່ານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງການໃຊ້ງານ..."

#. Error message
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:570
msgid "Cannot read config file /etc/sysconfig/kdump"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ /etc/sysconfig/kdump"

#. Error message
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:577
msgid "Cannot read kernel boot options."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານຕົວເລືອກການບູດເຄີເນິນໄດ້."

#. Error message
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:585
msgid "Cannot read available memory."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້."

#. Kdump read dialog caption
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:612
msgid "Saving kdump Configuration"
msgstr "ກຳລັງບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ kdump"

#. Progress stage 1/2
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:630
msgid "Write the settings"
msgstr "ຂຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. Progress stage 2/2
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:632
msgid "Update boot options"
msgstr "ອັບເດດຕົວເລືອກການບູດ"

#. Progress step 1/2
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:636
msgid "Writing the settings..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງຂຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ..."

#. Progress step 2/2
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:638
msgid "Updating boot options..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງອັບເດດຕົວເລືອກການບູດ..."

#. Progress finished
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:640
msgid "Finished"
msgstr "ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ"

#. Error message
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:651
msgid "Cannot write settings."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຂຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້."

#. Error message
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:661
