#. TRANSLATORS: warning message in installation proposal. Do not translate %{requested} and
#. %{available} - they are replaced with actual sizes later.
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:903
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Warning! There might not be enough free space to have kdump enabled. %"
"{required} required for saving a kernel dump, but only %{available} are "
"available."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳເຕືອນ! ອາດຈະມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງບໍ່ພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ kdump. ຕ້ອງການ %{required} ສຳລັບບັນທຶກການດັມພ໌"
"ເຄີເນິນ, ແຕ່ມີພຽງແຕ່ %{available} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. Trying to use fadump on unsupported hardware
#: src/modules/Kdump.rb:1011
msgid ""
"Cannot use Firmware-assisted dump.\n"
"It is not supported on this hardware."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ການດັມພ໌ທີ່ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໂດຍເຟີມແວໄດ້.\n"
"ມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນຮາດແວນີ້."
